"Syntax Highlighting"
syntax on

"Line numbers"
set number
set relativenumber

"Highlight searches incrementally as you search"
set hlsearch
set incsearch

"Clear the highlights with CTRL+l"
nnoremap <C-l> :noh<CR>

"Use CTRL+R CTRL+R to paste the yank register in insert mode"
inoremap <C-r><C-r> <C-r>0

"Use S to swap word with yanked register"
nnoremap S "_diwP
vnoremap S "_dP

"Backslash & h to substitute all occurrences of the word under the cursor
" The \< and \> ensure only compete words are found (IE foo is replaced but not food) 
:nnoremap <Leader>h :%s/\<<C-r><C-w>\>/

"[Insert tabs vs spaces discourse here]
filetype plugin indent on
" show existing tab with 4 spaces width
set tabstop=4
" when indenting with '>', use 4 spaces width
set shiftwidth=4
" On pressing tab, insert 4 spaces
set expandtab
